# Phase 5 T-U1-SAFE: Ctrl-O's argument, read and command rows over text a
# terminal would act on. One step: a command whose own text carries U+202E,
# U+200B, U+FEFF, ESC[2J, the C1 U+009B, a tab and (after a comment) a
# trailing CR, and that prints a file holding the same characters ended by
# CRLF, then a line a bare CR rewrites; then a read of that file. fx's
# `shell`/`run` is xfx's `terminal`/`exec`. TZ=UTC on both.
fx: gateway p5-transcript-safe-turns.json
xfx: gateway p5-transcript-safe-xfx.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
env TZ=UTC
work p5-transcript-safe-ws
wait 4
type show the file
wait 1
key Enter
wait 5
snap end
snapfull end
key C-o
wait 2
snap full
key PPage
wait 1
snap full-pgup
key C-o
wait 1
gwlog
